# To Cure a Cough (sandoria 20), each status operand alone (the GM sets the status, the other operands hold). Nenne, The
# Medicine Woman completed, toCureaCough 0, no medicine: available 538, accepted 584, completed 584. Amaura at DiaryPage
# 0, no key item (her default 642 alternates with the script): available silent, completed silent, accepted 645. The
# qm1, no moss: available nothing, completed nothing, accepted the Thyme Moss.
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-112.6,-6.9,105.2 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Sandoria.TheMedicineWoman completed
login
trigger Nenne                             # available: 538
finish                                    # toCureaCough 1
charvar toCureaCough 0
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough accepted
trigger Nenne                             # accepted: 584
finish
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough completed
trigger Nenne                             # completed: 584
finish
warp -82.4,-6.9,91.1 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Amaura                            # completed, DiaryPage 0
finish-if-event
trigger Amaura
finish-if-event
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough available
trigger Amaura                            # available, DiaryPage 0
finish-if-event
trigger Amaura
finish-if-event
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough accepted
trigger Amaura                            # accepted, DiaryPage 0, no key item
finish-if-event
trigger Amaura                            # 645 (the previous talk, line 28, took 642)
finish-if-event
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough available
warp -113.8,-0.4,-184.3 Davoi
trigger qm1                               # available, no moss: nothing
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough completed
trigger qm1                               # completed, no moss: nothing
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough available
quest Sandoria.ToCureACough accepted
trigger qm1                               # accepted, no moss: the Thyme Moss
